koronus-activity-auspex-triage-title = Lost auspex probe
koronus-activity-auspex-triage-summary = A damaged probe has been located in orbit. Follow its NAV signal and retrieve its telemetry by hand.
koronus-activity-route-survey-window-title = Survey window
koronus-activity-route-survey-window-summary = A surveyed corridor is temporarily safer: warp risk is reduced by one level and travel time by 10%.
koronus-activity-weak-distress-relay-title = Emergency capsule
koronus-activity-weak-distress-relay-summary = A rescue capsule is drifting in orbit. Follow its NAV signal, approach in EVA and read its emergency recorder.
koronus-activity-traffic-pattern-title = Unusual traffic
koronus-activity-traffic-pattern-summary = Outer vessels are altering routes without a port request
koronus-activity-chart-fragment-title = Chart fragment
koronus-activity-chart-fragment-summary = A verified chart fragment shortens this corridor's travel time by 15% while the signal remains valid.
koronus-activity-warp-weather-window-title = Warp weather window
koronus-activity-warp-weather-window-summary = The warp front has calmed: risk is reduced by one level and travel time by 20% until this window expires.
koronus-activity-hostile-warp-trace-title = Hostile warp trace
koronus-activity-hostile-warp-trace-summary = An unconfirmed trace leads toward an outer node
koronus-activity-hostile-raider-scout-title = Raider scout trace
koronus-activity-hostile-raider-scout-summary = A short engine flare does not match known vessels
koronus-activity-hostile-xeno-spore-warning-title = Xeno spore warning
koronus-activity-hostile-xeno-spore-warning-summary = The biosignature cannot confirm contact but requires observation
koronus-activity-aivorius-black-box-title = Aivorius black-box wreck
koronus-activity-aivorius-black-box-summary = Raiders occupy a wreck in Aivorius orbit. Follow its NAV signal, recover the black box and leave the grid holding it. Footfall's archive accepts the recorder.
koronus-activity-foulstone-survey-title = Foulstone survey ruins
koronus-activity-foulstone-survey-summary = Land on Foulstone, then open SECTOR for the survey ruins' distance and bearing from your ship. Recover the case and carry it off the grid. Footfall's survey intake accepts it.
koronus-activity-sottos-ice-rescue-title = Sotto's tomb ice rescue
koronus-activity-sottos-ice-rescue-summary = Land on Sotto's ice world and check SECTOR for the post's distance and bearing. Stabilize the surveyor, carry them off the ruined grid and deliver them to Footfall's Medicae intake.
koronus-activity-aivorius-cargo-title = Aivorius drifting cargo hold
koronus-activity-aivorius-cargo-summary = Raiders guard a drifting hold in Aivorius orbit. Follow its NAV signal, recover the manifest and carry it off the grid. Deliver it to Footfall's cargo counter.
koronus-activity-foulstone-mineshaft-title = Foulstone mine shaft
koronus-activity-foulstone-mineshaft-summary = Land on Foulstone and locate the shaft using the distance and bearing in SECTOR. Hormagaunts infest the site. Carry the core off the grid and deliver it to Footfall's Miners' Guild.
koronus-activity-sottos-cold-relay-title = Sotto cold relay
koronus-activity-sottos-cold-relay-summary = Land on Sotto's ice world and locate the relay using the distance and bearing in SECTOR. Carry the cipher case off the grid and deliver it to Footfall's astropathic archive.
koronus-activity-foulstone-assay-annex-title = Foulstone assay annex
koronus-activity-foulstone-assay-annex-summary = Land on Foulstone and check SECTOR for the annex's distance and bearing. Search the chambers and carry the sealed sample off the grid. Footfall's survey intake accepts it.
koronus-activity-sottos-cryo-archive-title = Sotto cryo-archive
koronus-activity-sottos-cryo-archive-summary = Land on Sotto's ice world and check SECTOR for the archive's distance and bearing. A warp doppelganger occupies the site. Carry out the ice specimen and deliver it to Footfall's astropathic archive.
koronus-activity-aivorius-survey-cutter-title = Aivorius survey cutter
koronus-activity-aivorius-survey-cutter-summary = Dock with the stranded cutter in Aivorius orbit. Its compartments contain raiders. Recover the flight log and return to your ship holding it; Footfall's archive accepts it.
koronus-activity-surface-vox-beacon-title = Surface vox beacon
koronus-activity-surface-vox-beacon-summary = Land in the system and take a manual relay reading
koronus-activity-surface-rescue-flare-title = Distress flare
koronus-activity-surface-rescue-flare-summary = Land in the system and read the final log; no ghost role is involved
koronus-activity-orbit-auspex-probe-title = Orbital auspex probe
koronus-activity-orbit-auspex-probe-summary = Reach the system and retrieve telemetry from one drifting probe
